=2 Walkthrough
You will have to collect 8 **dawndrops**. The following can be done in any order:
* {@k} {k:Ronfaure dawndrop}: automatically obtained at the start of this Mission.
* {@k} {k:Jugner dawndrop}: examine the {p:Blank Target} in {z:Jugner Forest (S)} at (I-6).
** {p:Survival Guide} to {z:East Ronfaure (S)}, then head east across the bridge in Jugner Forest (S), is the fastest way. It's nearby the Elegant Footprints from an earlier mission on the eastern side of the river.
* {@k} {k:La Vaule dawndrop}: examine the {p:Blank Target} in {z:La Vaule (S)} at (K-9), lower right of the grid next to a house.
** You can access {z:La Vaule (S)} from (G-11) in {z:Jugner Forest (S)}; there is a Survival Guide in {z:Jugner Forest (S)} right near the entrance.
* {@k} {k:San d'Oria dawndrop}: examine the {p:Blank Target} in {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} at (K-6).
** Near the **Lion Springs** Tavern.
* {@k} {k:Beaucedine dawndrop}: examine the {p:Blank Target} in {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} at (H-9).
** Down the ramp from the **Regal Pawprints** near the Campaign warp at (H-8).
* {@k} {k:Xarcabard dawndrop}: examine the {p:Blank Target} in {z:Xarcabard (S)} HP #1 at (F-8).
** Next to **Rally Point: Red**.
* {@k} {k:Throne Room dawndrop}: examine the {p:Blank Target} in {z:Throne Room (S)} (Castle Zvahl Keep [S], HP #1)
** Middle of walkway, west side.
* {@k} {k:Walk of Echoes dawndrop}: It is best to do this one last, as the next mission is at {p:Walk of Echoes}. Examine the {p:Blank Target} in {p:Walk of Echoes} south of the conflux.
** The C.A (Campaign Arbiter) Warp {z:Grauberg (S)} will bring you closest to reach the {p:Witchfire Glen} Veridical Conflux at (F-5) for this objective if you have little to no progress with {p:Voidwatch}.
** Use the Survival Guide to teleport to {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} and use the Veridical Conflux at (J-9) to enter and head east then south (This option **does** require progression through Voidwatch expansion).
** OR, enter from {z:Grauberg (S)} at (F-5) then head south.
** OR, if you have obtained the {@k} {k:Lightsworm}, you may use any blue **???** near the {p:Cavernous Maws|Cavernous Maw} surrounding {p:Jeuno} (past or present) to zone into {p:Walk of Echoes}, then head south to the {p:Blank Target}. May not work if you are on {M:Somber Dreams|Somber Dreams|Somber Dreams}.

When you have collected the 8th dawndrop, they will combine to give you the {@k} {k:Primal glow}.
